WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.960
A Proposal for Improving Library Service
关于改进图书馆服务的建议

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:16.360
As a frequent user of our school library, I would like to point out some of its current problems and propose possible solutions, in the hope of improving its service.
作为学校图书馆的常客，我想指出它目前存在的一些问题，并提出可行的解决办法，希望能改进它的服务。

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:20.460
At present, the library has three main problems.
目前，图书馆主要存在三个问题。

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:29.530
First, it is hard to find a seat, especially before exams, because some students save seats with books and then leave them empty for hours.
第一，座位很难找，尤其是在考试前，因为有些同学用书占座，然后让座位一空就是好几个小时。

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:37.480
Second, many popular books and textbooks have only one or two copies, so students often have to wait weeks to borrow them.
第二，许多热门书和教材只有一两本，所以同学们常常要等上好几周才能借到。

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:44.110
Third, the library closes at nine in the evening, which is too early for students who like to study at night.
第三，图书馆晚上九点就闭馆，这对喜欢在晚上学习的同学来说太早了。

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:48.390
To solve these problems, I suggest the following measures.
为了解决这些问题，我建议采取以下措施。

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:57.080
The library could introduce an online seat reservation system that releases a reserved seat if it is left empty for thirty minutes.
图书馆可以引入在线座位预约系统，如果预约的座位空置三十分钟，系统就自动将其释放。

00:00:57.880 --> 00:01:03.330
It could also buy more copies of popular books and offer electronic versions whenever possible.
它还可以增购热门书，并尽可能提供电子版。

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:09.160
Finally, extending the opening hours to eleven at night would greatly benefit students.
最后，把开放时间延长到晚上十一点会让同学们大大受益。

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:13.830
These changes would make the library a more welcoming place for learning.
这些改变会让图书馆成为一个更温馨宜人的学习场所。
